{"id":"n57278-2-9","stage":1,"title":"깎다 · 剪","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57278-2-9-1","ko":"머리를 왜 그렇게 짧게 깎았어?","zh":"为什么把头发剪得这么短啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"머리를","meaning":"头发","explanation":"머리：头发；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"머리","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66234","senseId":"3","lemma":"머리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"짧게","meaning":"短","explanation":"짧다：短；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"짧다","audio":"/audio/6dab7d40289b180d0cb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71363","senseId":"2","lemma":"짧다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"깎았어?","meaning":"剪","explanation":"깎다：剪；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"깎다","audio":"/audio/18d3575b885757d9618c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57278","senseId":"2","lemma":"깎다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"74eee3ddf202a62b","term":"머리","zh":"头发","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3","entryId":"66234","definition":"生长在头上的毛发。","pronunciation":["머리"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"6dab7d40289b180d","term":"짧다","zh":"短","audio":"/